    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῑσ-ητός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hateful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1228
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.10.5
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶς, ἔχειν πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zonar.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίσητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>lustful, lewd</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				316
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῑσήτη</span></b> , ἡ, <i>prostitute</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				184
			</span></i> (but the distn. of accent is not allowed by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.342
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>insatiate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i></div>
